      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "地下牢にいる親父を助け出す計画があるんだ。\n近いうちに闘技場で大きな騒ぎが起きるらしくて\nその騒ぎに混じって脱走させようと思ってる。\nよかったら、手伝ってくれたら嬉しいんだけど。",
        "official_en": "I have a plan to rescue my dad from the dungeon, but\nI need your help. I heard there'll be trouble in the\narena soon. I think we can use that as a distraction to\nget in, then we'll blend in with the crowd to get out.",
